      "title": "Transport watchdog investigates third near miss at Sydney airport",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/13/transport-watchdog-investigates-another-near-miss-at-sydney-airport",
      "description": "<p>Two planes came close to collision on the runway on Sunday – hours after another near miss – making a total of three in recent weeks</p><ul><li><p><strong>Get our </strong><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\"><strong>breaking news email</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\"><strong>free app</strong></a><strong> or </strong><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\"><strong>daily news podcast</strong></a></p></li></ul><p>The transport safety watchdog is investigating a a third near-collision between two planes at Sydney airport – the latest incident occurring hours after one that made national news and raised concerns about air traffic control.</p><p>The Australian Transport Safety Bureau (ATSB) said on Thursday night that it was investigating a second “runway incursion” <a href=\"https://www.atsb.gov.au/investigations/ao-2026-090\">on Sunday 9 August</a>.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/13/transport-watchdog-investigates-another-near-miss-at-sydney-airport\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
